 "notes": "Merged Moisturising cream + Lotion into Face moisturiser (lotion/emulsion as a type). Dropped as SKU noise: Anua PDRN cream, Centellian24 Madeca, S.NATURE Aqua Squalane (face); CYKLAR oil, three of four The Body Shop oils and the repeated 'Spa of the World' range (body oil); evolvetogether Taormina (hand cream). Olay Regenerist moved from m to an archetype. CeraVe brand entry not repeated (already in the register from shelf 00_00). Left out for lack of a retrievable source: launch year for Crème de la Mer, Clé de Peau La Crème's own launch year, Kiehl's eye cream year, Clinique DDML exact launch year; Neutrogena Norwegian Formula history. No traditions needed for this shelf. No independent test-winner pages retrieved, so no extra tier models added."
}